{
  "borough": "Harrow",
  "application_type": "All Other",
  "decision": "Refused",
  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span arial=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;In the absence of proposed section drawings detailing the internal head heights of the unit and a first floor plan, the proposal fails to demonstrate that the unit would be providing an overall acceptable standard of living accommodation. through sufficient&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;Gross Internal floor Area (GIA). &lt;span arial=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;The local planning authority is there unable to fully assess the proposal and is therefore contrary to policies DM1 C, DM1 D (g), DM26 A (a), and (c), and DM26 E of the Harrow Development Management Policies Local Plan (2013) and&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;Draft Harrow Local Plan (2021-2041): GR1&lt;/p&gt;",
    "&lt;p&gt;&lt;span arial=&quot;&quot;&gt;The proposal&amp;nbsp;results in poor-quality residential amenity and&amp;nbsp;lack of privacy&amp;nbsp;for the future occupiers of the ground floor flat due to a lack of defensible space to habitable room window(s). The proposal is therefore&amp;nbsp;contrary to Paragraph 131 of the National Planning Policy Framework (2024), Policy D6 of the London Plan (2021), Policy CS1 of the Harrow Core Strategy (2012), Policies DM 1 and DM 26 Harrow Development Management Policies Local Plan (2013) and the adopted Supplementary Planning Document: Residential Design Guide (2010) and&amp;nbsp;Draft Harrow Local Plan (2021-2041): GR1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;"
  ],
